{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"pnpm add @tanstack/charts svelte","lang":"sh"},{"type":"code","value":"<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\n  import { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\n  import { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/svelte'\n\n  const definition = $derived(\n    defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows), { tooltip }),\n  )\n</script>\n\n<Chart\n  {definition}\n  ariaLabel=\"Revenue by month\"\n  aspectRatio={16 / 9}\n/>","lang":"svelte"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The component uses Svelte 5 callback props and hydration-stable IDs. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"class"},{"type":"text","value":"\nand the string "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style"},{"type":"text","value":" prop target the outer host."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"lifecycle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lifecycle"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The component creates one shared adapter controller, forwards reactive props\nfrom an effect, mounts it in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onMount"},{"type":"text","value":", and destroys it through the mount\ncleanup. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Derive the complete\ndefinition when it captures reactive values."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"ssr-and-hydration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR and hydration"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte server rendering emits the complete "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ts-chart-host"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".ts-chart-surface"},{"type":"text","value":", and accessible SVG. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"initialWidth"},{"type":"text","value":" controls responsive\nserver geometry. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"$props.id()"},{"type":"text","value":" supplies the hydration-stable generated\nresource prefix. Keep server and browser definitions, formatters, and\ndimensions deterministic."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"presentation-and-rendering","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Presentation and rendering"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"class"},{"type":"text","value":" and the string "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"style"},{"type":"text","value":" prop apply to the outer host. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"className"},{"type":"text","value":"\napplies to the rendered chart surface. Interaction hooks such as\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onFocusChange"},{"type":"text","value":" are callback props, not dispatched Svelte events. The package\nstarts with SVG and can compose marks that use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"canvasChartRenderer"},{"type":"text","value":". Use\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"renderSvg"},{"type":"text","value":" to replace SVG serialization without replacing the shared host."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exports: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Chart"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartCommonProps"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPresentationProps"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartProps"},{"type":"text","value":",\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartTooltipBodySnippetContext"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartDefinition"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ChartPoint"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"tooltip-body-composition","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tooltip body composition"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pass a Svelte 5 "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tooltipBody"},{"type":"text","value":" snippet to render framework-owned content. Call\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultBody()"},{"type":"text","value":" to retain native rows and swatches. The shared host owns focus,\nplacement, portaling, inert transient state, pinning, and dismissal; Svelte\nowns the snippet lifecycle inside the body target."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See the "},{"type":"link","href":"./reference/chart.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Chart"},{"type":"text","value":" reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"SSR and hydration"}]},{"type":"text","value":",\nand "},{"type":"link","href":"../../reference/chart-definitions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chart Definition API"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"lifecycle","text":"Lifecycle","level":2},{"id":"ssr-and-hydration","text":"SSR and hydration","level":2},{"id":"presentation-and-rendering","text":"Presentation and rendering","level":2},{"id":"tooltip-body-composition","text":"Tooltip body composition","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```sh\npnpm add @tanstack/charts svelte\n```\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\n  import { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\n  import { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/svelte'\n\n  const definition = $derived(\n    defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows), { tooltip }),\n  )\n</script>\n\n<Chart\n  {definition}\n  ariaLabel=\"Revenue by month\"\n  aspectRatio={16 / 9}\n/>\n```\n\nThe component uses Svelte 5 callback props and hydration-stable IDs. `class`\nand the string `style` prop target the outer host.\n\n## Lifecycle\n\nThe component creates one shared adapter controller, forwards reactive props\nfrom an effect, mounts it in `onMount`, and destroys it through the mount\ncleanup. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Derive the complete\ndefinition when it captures reactive values.\n\n## SSR and hydration\n\nSvelte server rendering emits the complete `.ts-chart-host`,\n`.ts-chart-surface`, and accessible SVG. `initialWidth` controls responsive\nserver geometry. `$props.id()` supplies the hydration-stable generated\nresource prefix. Keep server and browser definitions, formatters, and\ndimensions deterministic.\n\n## Presentation and rendering\n\n`class` and the string `style` prop apply to the outer host. `className`\napplies to the rendered chart surface. Interaction hooks such as\n`onFocusChange` are callback props, not dispatched Svelte events. The package\nstarts with SVG and can compose marks that use `canvasChartRenderer`. Use\n`renderSvg` to replace SVG serialization without replacing the shared host.\n\nExports: `Chart`, `ChartCommonProps`, `ChartPresentationProps`, `ChartProps`,\n`ChartTooltipBodySnippetContext`, `ChartDefinition`, and `ChartPoint`.\n\n## Tooltip body composition\n\nPass a Svelte 5 `tooltipBody` snippet to render framework-owned content. Call\n`defaultBody()` to retain native rows and swatches. The shared host owns focus,\nplacement, portaling, inert transient state, pinning, and dismissal; Svelte\nowns the snippet lifecycle inside the body target.\n\nSee the [`Chart` reference](./reference/chart.md), [SSR and hydration](../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md),\nand [Chart Definition API](../../reference/chart-definitions.md).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Svelte Adapter\ndescription: Render and hydrate TanStack Charts with Svelte 5.\n---\n\n```sh\npnpm add @tanstack/charts svelte\n```\n\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { defineChart } from '@tanstack/charts'\n  import { tooltip } from '@tanstack/charts/tooltip'\n  import { Chart } from '@tanstack/charts/svelte'\n\n  const definition = $derived(\n    defineChart(createRevenueChart(rows), { tooltip }),\n  )\n</script>\n\n<Chart\n  {definition}\n  ariaLabel=\"Revenue by month\"\n  aspectRatio={16 / 9}\n/>\n```\n\nThe component uses Svelte 5 callback props and hydration-stable IDs. `class`\nand the string `style` prop target the outer host.\n\n## Lifecycle\n\nThe component creates one shared adapter controller, forwards reactive props\nfrom an effect, mounts it in `onMount`, and destroys it through the mount\ncleanup. Keep stable definitions at module scope. Derive the complete\ndefinition when it captures reactive values.\n\n## SSR and hydration\n\nSvelte server rendering emits the complete `.ts-chart-host`,\n`.ts-chart-surface`, and accessible SVG. `initialWidth` controls responsive\nserver geometry. `$props.id()` supplies the hydration-stable generated\nresource prefix. Keep server and browser definitions, formatters, and\ndimensions deterministic.\n\n## Presentation and rendering\n\n`class` and the string `style` prop apply to the outer host. `className`\napplies to the rendered chart surface. Interaction hooks such as\n`onFocusChange` are callback props, not dispatched Svelte events. The package\nstarts with SVG and can compose marks that use `canvasChartRenderer`. Use\n`renderSvg` to replace SVG serialization without replacing the shared host.\n\nExports: `Chart`, `ChartCommonProps`, `ChartPresentationProps`, `ChartProps`,\n`ChartTooltipBodySnippetContext`, `ChartDefinition`, and `ChartPoint`.\n\n## Tooltip body composition\n\nPass a Svelte 5 `tooltipBody` snippet to render framework-owned content. Call\n`defaultBody()` to retain native rows and swatches. The shared host owns focus,\nplacement, portaling, inert transient state, pinning, and dismissal; Svelte\nowns the snippet lifecycle inside the body target.\n\nSee the [`Chart` reference](./reference/chart.md), [SSR and hydration](../../guides/ssr-and-hydration.md),\nand [Chart Definition API](../../reference/chart-definitions.md).\n"}
